{"3756110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Runaway Rumble", "steam_appid": 3756110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756110/extras/3e02e198db62c26f2b9a2c3fbfde7a03.avif?t=1782220328\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Runaway Rumble</i>, the ultimate action-sports PvP experience where speed, strategy, and supernatural powers collide! RR takes things to the next level by throwing in <strong>parkour mechanics</strong> and <strong>game-changing character abilities</strong> all set in breathtaking multiverse arenas.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Story: The Multiverse Showdown Begins</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756110/extras/ac8f1bf883b226779490c799558ce051.poster.avif?t=1782220328\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756110/extras/ac8f1bf883b226779490c799558ce051.webm?t=1782220328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756110/extras/ac8f1bf883b226779490c799558ce051.mp4?t=1782220328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the vast expanse of the multiverse, a legendary sport was born  <strong>Runaway Rumble</strong>. Every world across time, space, and reality sends its top two champions, blessed with extraordinary powers, to compete in this ultimate tournament. <br>Their goal?<br><strong>Win matches. Earn trophies. Unlock the mysterious final reward.</strong><br>Only those who dominate the competition and rise through the ranks from <strong>Freerun</strong> to <strong>Pursuit</strong>  will uncover the game’s hidden secrets and reach a rank known only to the most elite.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >14 Unique Characters - 14 Unique Abilities and the roster keeps growing &quot;The Rumble Never Stops&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>14 multiverse champions</strong>, each with their own <strong>special ability</strong>, from teleporting clones and invisibility to projectiles that freeze, blind, or knock down opponents. Pair them with <strong>common powers</strong> like dashes, wall runs, high jumps, and speed boosts to outmaneuver your rival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every duo of characters brings a themed map with themed battle in an icy Viking arena, dodge through an ancient Roman coliseum, or trick your enemy in a cursed jungle ruin. Each map is crafted with verticality and flow for intense chases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756110/extras/8149c92055fd1ecdeb10ccd7958c5014.poster.avif?t=1782220328\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756110/extras/8149c92055fd1ecdeb10ccd7958c5014.webm?t=1782220328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756110/extras/8149c92055fd1ecdeb10ccd7958c5014.mp4?t=1782220328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756110/extras/0c9665df3c9c1cd5497a8486dceefad9.avif?t=1782220328\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756110/extras/9ec1fac819c30e4d189b9fe715bf44eb.avif?t=1782220328\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756110/extras/c1b735b4ad7dd9f0f2fc0eb277cb5796.avif?t=1782220328\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><br><br><strong>Why Play Runaway Rumble?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Pure PvP chase escape combat focused on skill, not luck</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Unique ability driven characters with distinct playstyles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Fast rounds built for intense competitive moments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Every match is a mind game. Every move matters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Designed to create clutch moments and real rivalries<br><br>Casual or Competitive</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop in solo to practice your parkour skills or face real opponents in competitive multiplayer modes. Whether you're here for fun or fame, RR delivers the thrill of the chase every time.<br><strong>Closed Beta Access</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want early access to Runaway Rumble?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord, secure the slot and compete before everyone else.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756110/extras/3e02e198db62c26f2b9a2c3fbfde7a03.avif?t=1782220328\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Runaway Rumble</i>, the ultimate action-sports PvP experience where speed, strategy, and supernatural powers collide! RR takes things to the next level by throwing in <strong>parkour mechanics</strong> and <strong>game-changing character abilities</strong> all set in breathtaking multiverse arenas.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Story: The Multiverse Showdown Begins</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756110/extras/ac8f1bf883b226779490c799558ce051.poster.avif?t=1782220328\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756110/extras/ac8f1bf883b226779490c799558ce051.webm?t=1782220328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756110/extras/ac8f1bf883b226779490c799558ce051.mp4?t=1782220328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the vast expanse of the multiverse, a legendary sport was born  <strong>Runaway Rumble</strong>. Every world across time, space, and reality sends its top two champions, blessed with extraordinary powers, to compete in this ultimate tournament. <br>Their goal?<br><strong>Win matches. Earn trophies. Unlock the mysterious final reward.</strong><br>Only those who dominate the competition and rise through the ranks from <strong>Freerun</strong> to <strong>Pursuit</strong>  will uncover the game’s hidden secrets and reach a rank known only to the most elite.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >14 Unique Characters - 14 Unique Abilities and the roster keeps growing &quot;The Rumble Never Stops&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>14 multiverse champions</strong>, each with their own <strong>special ability</strong>, from teleporting clones and invisibility to projectiles that freeze, blind, or knock down opponents. Pair them with <strong>common powers</strong> like dashes, wall runs, high jumps, and speed boosts to outmaneuver your rival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every duo of characters brings a themed map with themed battle in an icy Viking arena, dodge through an ancient Roman coliseum, or trick your enemy in a cursed jungle ruin. Each map is crafted with verticality and flow for intense chases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756110/extras/8149c92055fd1ecdeb10ccd7958c5014.poster.avif?t=1782220328\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756110/extras/8149c92055fd1ecdeb10ccd7958c5014.webm?t=1782220328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756110/extras/8149c92055fd1ecdeb10ccd7958c5014.mp4?t=1782220328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756110/extras/0c9665df3c9c1cd5497a8486dceefad9.avif?t=1782220328\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756110/extras/9ec1fac819c30e4d189b9fe715bf44eb.avif?t=1782220328\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756110/extras/c1b735b4ad7dd9f0f2fc0eb277cb5796.avif?t=1782220328\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><br><br><strong>Why Play Runaway Rumble?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Pure PvP chase escape combat focused on skill, not luck</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Unique ability driven characters with distinct playstyles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Fast rounds built for intense competitive moments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Every match is a mind game. Every move matters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Designed to create clutch moments and real rivalries<br><br>Casual or Competitive</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop in solo to practice your parkour skills or face real opponents in competitive multiplayer modes. Whether you're here for fun or fame, RR delivers the thrill of the chase every time.<br><strong>Closed Beta Access</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want early access to Runaway Rumble?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord, secure the slot and compete before everyone else.</p>", "short_description": "Runaway Rumble is a fast-paced PvP action-sports game where players chase or escape using parkour and powerful abilities. Set in multiverse arenas, each character brings unique powers and style. Run. Chase. Rumble!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756110/e812bd22ce2950de00247ce6e47e625504fe7479/header.jpg?t=1782220328", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756110/b39bec3ad835defd8d3f1952c7ab968539583096/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782220328", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756110/b39bec3ad835defd8d3f1952c7ab968539583096/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782220328", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5 9thgen <br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 25 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor: